namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamPassPipeline {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassPipeline.h#DreamPassPipeline
    src   "A Custom Pass pipeline: named buffers, an ordered list of passes each with its own injection point, and the\nparameters an activation can override. What a `.dsp` source compiles to, and what it decompiles from.\n\nPlain data. Nothing here runs: UDreamPassSubsystem decides which pipelines apply to a view and with what\nparameter values, and the scene view extension runs their passes. Editing the asset in the details panel\ntakes effect on the next frame; Adopt Into Source writes the edit back to the `.dsp`."
    text  "一段 Custom Pass 管线：具名缓冲、有序的 Pass 列表（每个 Pass 各有注入点），以及\n激活时可以覆盖的参数。`.dsp` 源码编译成它，也从它反编译。\n\n纯数据。这里不执行任何东西：由 UDreamPassSubsystem 决定哪些管线在哪个视图生效、用哪些\n参数值，场景视图扩展执行它们的 Pass。在细节面板修改资产会在下一帧\n生效；Adopt Into Source 会把改动写回 `.dsp`。"
    state machine
}

DreamPassPipeline:bHasSharedHlsl {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassPipeline.h#DreamPassPipeline:bHasSharedHlsl
    src   "The `.dsp` has a file-level `hlsl { }` block (it may be empty)."
    text  "该 `.dsp` 有一个文件级 `hlsl { }` 块（可以为空）。"
    state machine
}

DreamPassPipeline:DefaultInjection {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassPipeline.h#DreamPassPipeline:DefaultInjection
    src   "The injection point of a pass that does not name one. Informational once compiled: every pass carries its own."
    text  "未指定注入点的 Pass 所使用的注入点。编译后仅供查看：每个 Pass 都带有自己的注入点。"
    state machine
}

DreamPassPipeline:EnabledParameter {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassPipeline.h#DreamPassPipeline:EnabledParameter
    src   "A Bool parameter; the whole pipeline is off in a view where it is false. None: always on."
    text  "一个布尔参数；在它为假的视图里整条管线关闭。None：始终开启。"
    state machine
}

