DreamPassPipeline:SharedHlsl {
    at    Source/DreamShaderPass/Public/DreamPassPipeline.h#DreamPassPipeline:SharedHlsl
    src   "That block: the text between its braces, verbatim. Its shared functions are compiled with every inline pass, its\nentries with the passes that name them (EDreamPassHlslSource::Shared). Kept for the way back to text; what runs is\neach slot's snapshot."
    text  "该块：两花括号之间的文本，逐字保留。它的共享函数会随每个内联 Pass 一起编译，其条目随引用它们的 Pass 编译（EDreamPassHlslSource::Shared）。保留它是为了回写文本；真正执行的是各槽位的快照。"
    state machine
}

